  "goodToKnow": "Zollen means to pay or show, almost only in fixed phrases: jemandem Respekt, Anerkennung, Beifall zollen. Tribut zollen means to pay tribute, and also to pay the price: Das Team zollte der Hitze Tribut (the heat took its toll). Der Zoll means customs, a duty, and an inch (as in 27-Zoll-Monitor). Regular: zollte, gezollt."
